<title>ITALY: CIR, Sasib shares suspended.</title>
<headline>CIR, Sasib shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian stock market authority Consob on Friday suspended for the day the shares of Italian holding company CIR and engineering group Sasib, which CIR controls.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Consob said that both shares were suspended ahead of a statement.</p>
<p>A seperate CIR statement said that the CIR board is expected to meet on Saturday May 17 and a statement is expected to be issued late on Saturday afternoon.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
